            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a bladder comprising: a first chamber having a substantially U-shape; a second chamber having a substantially U-shape and being spaced apart from the first chamber in a direction extending along a longitudinal axis of the bladder; and a web area defining the first chamber and the second chamber; wherein the first chamber includes a first leg and a second leg joined by a first arcuate segment and the second chamber includes a third leg and a fourth leg joined by a second arcuate segment; wherein the first leg and the second leg are disposed between the first arcuate segment and the second arcuate segment; wherein the web area includes a first portion being bell-shaped and a second portion having a substantially U-shape; wherein the first chamber is attached to the first portion of the web area; and wherein the second chamber is attached to the second portion of the web area.</p>
            </abstract>
